<title>USA: Teleflex sees 1996 as record year.</title>
<headline>Teleflex sees 1996 as record year.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH MEETING, Pa. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teleflex Inc said Wednesday that 1996 would be a record year, after the company reported third quarter net income of $0.56 per share or $10 million, a 22 percent increase over $8.25 million a year ago.</p>
<p>&quot;We are pleased with the momentum in our businesses and the foundation that has been laid for future growth.  We anticipate that 1996 will be another record year,&quot; the company stated.  </p>
<p>For fiscal 1995 the company reported sales of $913 million, net income $48.9 million and earnings of $2.75 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
